<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Galatians</para>
  <para style="toc1">GALATIA-GI Misingda I-ba Paul-gi Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">GALATIA-GI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Misingda I-ba Paul-gi Chithi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">Jisugi Aphaba Paona Jihudi nattaba misingda sandokpa hourabada amadi makhoina lousillabada, asengba christian ama oinabagidamak Moses-ki Wayel Yathang adu ingadra nattraga illoidabra haiba wahang ama thoraklammi. Paul-na madu mathou tade haina yetli madudi tasengna hairabada, Christtada hingba punsi amagidamak amata ngairaba yumpham adudi madugi mapanna mi pumnamakpu Tengban Mapugi mangda chumhanbiriba thajaba aduni. Adubu Asia Minor-da leiba Rome leingakki lam Galatia-da leiba singlupsinggi marakta Tengban Mapugi mangda chumhanbinaba Moses-ki Wayel Yathang adusu thajaba amana ngakkadabani haina haiba Paul-gi maiyokta leppa mising thoraklammi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul-na AD. 48-49 aduwaida Galatia-gi misingda ikhiba chithi asi asigumba lanna tambiba asina lanna lamjingbikhraba mising adubu asengba thajaba amadi chatnabising aduda amuk hanna puraknabagidamak ikhibani. Jisu Christtagi pakhonchatpa ama koubagi mahakki hak adugi maramda palladuna chithi asi hou-i. Mahakpu pakhonchatpa ama oina koubiba adu karigumba mioibagi matik amatadagi natte adubu Tengban Mapudagini haiba aduga mahakki thougal adu akhannana Jihudi nattabasinggi maraktani haina mahakna kanna hai. Adudagi mahakna thajabakhaktagi mapanna misingbu Tengban Mapugi mangda chumhanbi haiduna yetnaba adu sengdok-i. Aroiba pandupsingda Christtabu thajabadagi mahei oiriba nungsiba adudagi Christian-singgi machat adu mahousana thokcharak-i haibadu Paul-na utli.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Wahoudok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 1:1-10">1:1-10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Pakhonchatpa ama oina Paul-gi matik <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:21">1:11–2:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Tengban Mapugi thoujalgi aphaba pao <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 3:1-4:31">3:1–4:31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Christian-gi ningtamba amasung toupham thokpa thoudang <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1–6:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Waroisin <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Misingdagi nattaba aduga misinggi mapandagisu nattaba, adubu Jisu Christta amadi Ibungobu asibadagi hinggat-hanbiba Mapa Ibungo Tengban Mapugi mapandagi pakhonchatpa ama oina koubiraba Paul eina, <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Aduga eiga mapham asida loinariba thajaba ichil-inao pumnamakna khurumjabagi wahei asi Galatia-da leiriba singlupsingda thajari.<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapu amadi Ibungo Jisu Christtana nakhoida thoujal amadi ingthaba pinabiba oisanu.<verse eid="GAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Eikhoibu houjikki phattraba chak asidagi kanbinaba eikhoigi Tengban Mapu amadi Ipa adugi aningba adubu injaduna eikhoigi papkidamak Christtana masamakpu katthokpire. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Lomba naida naidana Tengban Mapuda matik mangal oisanu. Amen!<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aphaba Pao asi nattaba atei amata leite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Christtagi thoujalda hingnanaba nakhoibu koubiba mahakpu asuk thuna thadoktuna tonganba aphaba pao amada nakhoina onsinkhiba asida ei ngak-i. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Asengbamak “Atoppa aphaba pao” ama leite, adubu nakhoibu pukning olhanba amasung Christtagi Aphaba Pao adubu hongdoknaba hotnaba mi khara leibagi maramna eina masi haibani. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Adubu eikhoimakna nattraga swargadagi dut amana eikhoina nakhoida sandokkhiba aphaba pao adu nattaba tonganba aphaba pao ama sandoklabadi mahak norokta tasanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Eikhoina masi hannasu haikhre, aduga houjik amukkasu hanna hairi: Nakhoina lousinkhraba Aphaba pao adu nattaba tonganba Aphaba Pao ama nakhoida kanagumbana sandoklabadi, mahak norokta tasanu.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Houjik eina misingna yanaba hotnaribra nattraga Tengban Mapuna yanaba hotnaribra? Nattraga eina misingbu pelhannaba hotnaribra? Karigumba eina houjikphaoba misingbu pelhannaba hotnaramlabadi, eina Christtagi manai oiramloidabani.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul-bu Tengban Mapuna koubiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Ichil-inaosa, eina sandokkhiba aphaba pao asi mioibadagi lakpa natte haibasi eina nakhoida khanghanjaning-i. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Masi eina mi kanadagisu phangkhiba natte aduga kananasu eingonda tambikhiba natte. Adubu Jisu Christta masamakna masi eingonda phongdokpibani.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Pakhon 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char>
    </note>Eina Jihudigi laining laisonda lupcharingei matamda eina karamna hinglamba, eina Tengban Mapugi singluppu karamna minungsi yaodana ot-neiramba aduga madubu manghannaba angamba thakta hotnaramba adu nakhoina takhre. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Pakhon 22:3</ref></char></note>Jihudi laining lichatta eina atoppa lengmannaba Jihudi kayadagi mang tharammi amasung eikhoigi ipa-ipugi chatnabisingda kayada henna thawai yaojarammi.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15,16</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Pakhon 9:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref></char>
    </note>Adubu eina imagi pibuknungda leiringeidagi mahakki thoujalna Tengban Mapuna eihakpu mahakki thougal tounaba koubire. Amasung mahakna wa lepkhrabada, <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>haibadi mahakki Aphaba Pao adubu atoppa phurupsingda sandoknabagidamak Machanupa adubu iphamda phongdoknaba lepkhrabada, eina mi kanagi maphamdasu wa tannanaba chatkhide. <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Aduga eigi mangda pakhonchatpa oirambasing adubu unanaba Jerusalem-dasu chatkhide. Madugi mahutta eina khudak aduda Arabia-da chatlammi aduga adudagi eina Damascus-ta halakkhi. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Pakhon 9:26-30</ref></char></note>Adudagi eina chahi ahum leiraba matungda, Peter-dagi pao phangnabagidamak Jerusalem-da chatlammi amasung mahakka loinana numit taramangani leiminnarammi. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Aduga eina Ibungogi manao Jacob nattana atei pakhonchatpa kana amatabu ukhide.<verse eid="GAL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Eina iriba asi achumbani. Eina minamba ngangde haiba Tengban Mapuna khang-i!<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Madugi matungda eina Syria amadi Cilicia-gi maphamsingda chatlammi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Matam aduda Christtada leiba Judea-gi singlupki misingna eibu hakthengnana sakkhanglamde. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Makhoina khangba haibabu “Eikhoibu mamangda ot-neiramba nupa asina mahakna matam amada mang-hannanaba hotnaramba thajaba adu houjik sandokli” haina misingna hainaba adu khaktani. <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Aduga makhoina eigi maramgidamak Tengban Mapubu thagatcharammi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Paul-bu atoppa Pakhonchatpasingna lousinjaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:30">Pakhon 11:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref></char>
    </note> Chahi taramarigi matungda eina Barnabas-ka loinana Titus-pu puraduna Jerusalem-da amuk chatlammi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Madu Tengban Mapuna eingonda chatlu haina phongdokpibagi maramna chatpani. Aduga luchingbasing aduga lanai tonganna unaduna eina atoppa phurupsingda sandokpa aphaba pao adugi maramda makhoida sandokna tamle. Madu eina houkhibada toukhiba amadi houjik touriba thabaksing adu arembada tahanba pamdabagini. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Aduga, eigi mapang oiriba Titus-na Greek macha oidunasu mangonda un kaknanaba namlamde. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Adubu makhoi kharanadi madu pangthok-hanba pamkhi. Christta Jisuga amata oiminnabagi mapanna eikhoida leiriba ningtamba adu khangdoknabagidamak mising asina thajaba mi sasinnaduna lonna lanjaba amagum eikhoigi irakta changlakkhi. Makhoina eikhoibu minai oihanba pamkhi. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Adubu Aphaba Paogi achumba adu nakhoigidamak mang-handana thamnabagidamak makhoida eikhoina mikup ama phaoba pikhide.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Aniwa 10:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aduga maruoiba luchingbasingni haina lounariba makhoising adugi oinadi, (eina masi haibagi maramdi makhoina kari kari oirabasu eingonda karisu khetnaba leihande; Tengban Mapudi mapanthonggi oiba aduna wayende), eina sandokliba pao aduda makhoina karisu hapchinningai leikhide. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Madugi onnabada, Jihudisingda aphaba pao sandoknabagidamak Tengban Mapuna Peter-da thoudang pinabibagum Jihudi nattaba phurupsingda aphaba pao sandoknaba Tengban Mapuna iphamda thoudang pinabiba adu makhoina ukhi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Maramdi Peter-bu Jihudisinggidamak pakhonchatpa oihanbikhiba adugumna Tengban Mapugi panggalna eihakpusu atoppa phurupsinggidamak pakhonchatpa oihanbire. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Tengban Mapuna akhannaba thabak asi eingonda pinabire haina singlupki yumbini haina ikaikhumnariba Jacob, Peter amadi John-na khanglabada eikhoi pumnamak thougal touminnabasingni haibagi khudam oina Barnabas amadi eigi khut sokpire. Aduga Barnabas amasung eina Jihudi nattaba phurupsingda aduga makhoina Jihudisingda thougal touba haina eikhoina yanakhi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Amasung makhoigi marakta leiriba laira-anangsingbu eikhoina ningsingbiyu haina makhoina hairammi. Masimak eina touningbana ikhoulangliba thabak adumakni.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul-na Peter-bu Antioch-ta cheiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Adubu Peter-na Antioch-ta lakpa matamda, miyam mangda eina mahakki maiyokta lepkhi. Maramdi mahak sengna lallammi. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Maramdi Jacob-na tharakpa mising aduna mapham aduda thungladringei mamangda Peter-na Jihudi nattaba atoppa phurupki thajabasing aduga chamin-thakminnarammi. Adubu makhoina thunglarabada mahakna Jihudi nattabasing adudagi lapthoraklammi amasung chamin-thaminnaramde, maramdi makhoibu un kakpa pamba makhoising adubu mahakna kirammi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Aduga atoppa Jihudigi maraktagi thajabasing adunasu Peter-gi pangdaba matou adugumna touba houraklammi. Madudi makhoigi pangdaba matou aduna Barnabas phaoba lanna lamjinglammi. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Makhoina Aphaba Pao adugi achumba adugi matung-inna chumna chattre haiba urabada, makhoi pumnamakki mamangda eina Peter-da haikhi, “Nahak Jihudi amani, adumakpu nahakna Jihudi amagumna nattaduna atoppa phurupki mi amagi matougum hingli. Adu oiragadi kamdouna nahakna atoppa phurupki misingda Jihudigi chatnabising adu illu haina namlibano?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thajabagi mapanna Jihudi amadi Jihudi nattabasingbu kanbiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Eikhoidi pokpadagi Jihudisingni, aduga atoppa phurupsinggumna papchenbasing natte. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Isei 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rom 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:22">3:22</ref></char></note>Adumakpu mi amabu wayel yathanggi thabakki mapanna keidounungda Tengban Mapugi mangda chumhanbiba natte adubu Jisu Christtada thajabakhaktagi mapanna chumhanbibani haiba adu eikhoi khang-i. Maram aduna eikhoinasu, wayel yathanggi thabakki mapanna nattana Christtada thajabagi mapanna eikhoibu Tengban Mapugi mangda chumhanbinanaba Christta Jisuda eikhoina thajare. Maramdi wayel yathanggi thabakki mapanna mi kana amatabu chumhanbide. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Adubu eikhoina Christtagi mapanna Tengban Mapugi mangda chumhanbinaba thibada, eikhoibu atoppa phurupsinggumna papchenba oina phanglabadi pap touhannabagidamak Christtana thougal tou-i hairibra? Madu suknat natte. <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Eina thugaikhraba wayel yathanggi pathap adubu eina amuk hanna sagatlabadi eihak wayel yathang thugaiba amani haiba isana utchabani. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Maramdi eina Tengban Mapugidamak hingjanaba eina wayel yathanggi mapanna wayel yathangda sire. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Eina Christtaga loinana cross-ta siminnare aduga hingliba asi ei natte, adubu Christtana eingonda hingbibani. Eina houjik hingjariba punsi asi eibu nungsibiriba amadi eihakkidamak masagi punsi katthokpikhraba Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adu thajabagi mapannani. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Tengban Mapugi thoujal adu eina kakthatpa toude. Maramdi wayel yathanggi mapanna mi amabu Tengban Mapugi mangda chumhanbiba oiramlabadi, Christtana sibiba adu aremba oihalle.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Wayel yathang amasung thajaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Ho apangba Galatia-gi misa! Kanana nakhoibu sumkhrabage? Jisu Christtana cross-ta sibikhiba adu nakhoigi mitmangda thokkhibagum madugi wahanthok adu nakhoida sandokna haikhre. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Eina nakhoidagi wa amakhak khangba pammi: Nakhoina Tengban Mapugi Thawai adu wayel yathanggi thabakki mapanna phanglibra nattraga nakhoina takhraba Aphaba pao adu thajabagi mapanna phanglibra? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Nakhoina karigi aduk yamna panglibano? Nakhoina Thawaigi mapanna houkhraga houjik nakhoina hakchanggi mapanna loisinnaba hotnaribra? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Nakhoina arembada asuk yamna awaba khanglabra? Tasengnamak madu aremba oirabra? <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Tengban Mapuna nakhoida wayel yathanggi thabakki mapanna Thawai adu pibra amadi angakpa thabaksing toubra nattraga nakhoina takhraba Aphaba Pao adu thajabagi mapannara?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:6">Meihou 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom 4:3</ref></char>
    </note>Abraham-na thengnakhiba adu nakhoina wakhal tou; Mapugi Puyada haikhibagumna, “Mahakna Tengban Mapubu thajakhi aduga mahakki thajaba adugi mapanna Tengban Mapuna mahakpu achumba chatpa ama oina singthanabikhi.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Rom 4:16</ref></char></note>Adu oirabadi thajaba leiba makhoising adu Abraham-gi asengba chada-naodasingni haiba nakhoina khanggadabani. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Meihou 12:3</ref></char></note>Atoppa phurupsingbu thajabagi mapanna Tengban Mapuna chumhanbigani haina Mapugi Puyada mangjounana phongdokpikhre. Aduga asumna Mapugi Puyana Abraham-da Aphaba Pao asi laothokle, “Nahakki napanna Tengban Mapuna mi pumnamakpu yaipha thoujal phangjagani.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Abraham-na thajakhi amasung yaipha thoujal phangjakhi; aduga asumna thajaraba makhoi pumnamakna Abraham-na oikhibagumna yaipha thoujal phangjagani.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Aniwa 27:26</ref> </char>
    </note>Wayel yathang ngakchabada tangjariba makhoising adu sirapki makhada hinglibani. Maramdi Mapugi Puyada asumna iduna lei, “Wayel Yathanggi lairikta iriba khudingmakpu matam pumnamakta ngakpa ngamdaba mi khudingmak Tengban Mapugi sirap phanglabani.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Heb 2:4</ref></char></note>Adudi houjik masi mayek sengle madudi Tengban Mapugi mangda mi kana amatabu Wayel Yathanggi mapanna chumhanbide. Maramdi Mapugi Puyana hai, “Thajabagi mapanna Tengban Mapuna chumhanbiraba mi adukhaktana hinggani.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Levi 18:5</ref></char></note>Adubu Wayel Yathangdi thajabada yumpham oide. Madugi onnabada Mapugi Puyana asumna hai, “Wayel Yathangna haiba khudingmakpu touba mahak aduna hingjagani.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:23">Aniwa 21:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adubu Christtana eikhoigidamak sirap oibiraduna Wayel Yathangna purakpa sirap adudagi eikhoibu handokpire; maramdi Mapugi Puyana hai, “Uthakta yanba mi pumnamak adu Tengban Mapugi sirap phanglabani.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Jisu Christtagi mapanna Tengban Mapuna Abraham-da wasakpikhiba yaipha thoujal adu atoppa phurupsingda pibinabagidamak Christtana masi toubikhibani. Masi thajabagi mapanna Tengban Mapuna wasakpikhiba Thawai adu eikhoina phangjanabagidamaktani.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayel yathang amasung wasakpiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Ichil-Inaosa, eikhoigi nungtigi punsida thokpa khudam ama eina pijage. Mi anina karigumba hiram amada yanakhrabadi aduga yannache innakhrabadi madu mi kana amatana thugaiba ngamde aduga maduda kari amata hapchinba ngamde. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Aduga Tengban Mapuna mahakki wasaksing adu Abraham amasung mahakki chada-naodada pibikhi. Masida Mapugi Puyana “Chada-naodasingda” haibadi mi mayamda haikhide adubu “Chada-naodada” haibadi mi amatagi maramda haikhi, madu Christtani. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Khong 12:40</ref></char></note>Eina hairiba asi masini: Tengban Mapuna Abraham-da warepnaba ama pibikhi aduga madu ngakkani haina wasakpikhi. Aduga chahi chamari khunthragi matungda pikhiba Wayel Yathang aduna warepnaba adubu thugaiba ngamde aduga asumna wasak adubu kakthatpa ngamde. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Rom 4:14</ref></char></note>Maramdi Tengban Mapugi khudol adu Wayel Yathangda tangjaba oirabadi madu Tengban Mapugi wasakpibada tangjaba amuk oidre. Adumakpu Tengban Mapuna Abraham-da khudol adubu pikhiba adu mahakki wasak adugi maramnani.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Adu oirabadi Wayel Yathang pinabiribasi karino? Madu ayol aral touba haibasi karino haiba utpinabagidamak hapchinbibani aduga madu wasakpikhiba Abraham-gi chada naoda aduna lenglaktribaphaobagini. Wayel Yathang adu taisinnabiba mi amada swarga dutsinggi khuthangda sinnakhi. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Adumakpu taisinnabiba adu kangbu amakhakta oiba matamda mathou tade adubu Tengban Mapudi amakhaktani.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayel yathang pibagi maram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Adu oirabadi Wayel Yathang asi Tengban Mapugi wasaksing adugi maiyoktara? Madu khak oidasanu! Maramdi hingba piba ngamba wayel yathang ama mioibana phanglamlabadi madu injaduna Tengban Mapuna makhoibu chumhanbiramgadabani. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Adubu Mapugi Puyana hai madudi taibangpan apumba asi papki panggal makhada leire; aduga asumna Jisu Christtabu thajabada yumpham oiduna wasakpikhiba khudol adu thajabasing aduda pinabire.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Adubu thajaba aduna laktringeigi mamangda, Wayel Yathang aduna eikhoi pumnamakpu lakkadouba thajaba adu phongdoktriba phaoba phadok oina phajinduna thamlammi. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Maram aduna eikhoibu thajabagi mapanna chumhanbinaba Christtana lenglaktriphaoba Wayel Yathangna eikhoibu yengsinbibagi thougal toubasing adu oire. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Adubu houjikti thajaba adu lakle, aduga eikhoi yengsinbiba adugi makhada leitre.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Maram aduna thajabagi mapanna nakhoina Christta Jisuda amata oina punsinjaduna Tengban Mapugi machasing oijare. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Maramdi Christtada baptize louraba nakhoi pumnamakna Christtabu phi setpagum setle. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Maram aduna Jihudi nattraga Greek, minai nattraga ningtamba, nupa nattraga nupigi marakta khetnaba karisu leite; maramdi nakhoi pumnamak Christta Jisuda amatani. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Rom 4:13</ref></char></note>Nakhoina Christtagi oirabadi nakhoi Abraham-gi chada-naodasingni aduga wasakpibagi matung-inna nakhoi yumlep charasingni.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Eina haibadi yumlepchara aduna pumnamakki mapu oirabasu mahakna angang oiriba makheidi mahakna minai amaga khetnaba karisu leite. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Yumlep chara adu mapa aduna lepkhiba matam adu youdriba phaobadi mahakpu sennabiriba mising amadi asin arang touriba mising adugi makha ponna lei. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Matou adugumduna eikhoina thawaigi oina mapung phadringeigi mamangda eikhoisu taibangpan asigi thawaigi oiba pangalsing adugi minai oiduna leirammi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Adubu matam aduna pumsu surabada Tengban Mapuna mahakki Machanupabu thabirakle. Mahakna taibangda nupi amagi macha ama oina lenglakkhi aduga mahakna Jihudigi Wayel Yathanggi makha ponna leikhi. <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Rom 8:15-17</ref></char></note>Madu eikhoina Tengban Mapugi machasing oiraknanaba Wayel Yathanggi makha ponna leirambasing adubu handokpinabani.<verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Aduga nakhoi mahakki machasing oibagi maramna Tengban Mapuna mahakki Machanupagi Thawai adubu eikhoigi thamoinungda thabirakle aduga Thawai aduna “Abba, Ipa” haina koujei. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Maram aduna nahak makha tana minai oidre adubu Tengban Mapugi macha oire. Aduga nahakna mahakki macha oirabanina mahakna machasinggidamak thambiriba pumnamak adu Tengban Mapuna nangonda pinabigani.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul-na Galatia-gi misinggidamak khanjaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Mamangda nakhoina Tengban Mapu khangdringei matamda, mahousana Tengban Mapu nattaba makhoising adugi minai oiduna leirammi. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Adubu houjikti nakhoina Tengban Mapubu khangle aduga henna Tengban Mapunasu nakhoibu khangle. Aduga karamna nakhoina asonba amadi karisu kanadaba pangalsing aduda hanba pamlibano? Karigi nakhoina amuk hanna makhoising adugi minai oiba pamlibano? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Nakhoina akhannaba numit, tha, kum-tha amadi chahi ngaktuna lei. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Ei nakhoigidamak ki! Eina nakhoigidamak nomjakhiba thabak pumnamak adu arembada touba taragadra.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Ichil inaosing eina nakhoida haijari, eigumna oibiyu maramdi eina nakhoigumna oirakle. Nakhoina eingonda aranba karisu toukhide. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Eigi hakchangda anaba leibagi maramna eina ahanba oina nakhoida Aphaba Pao sandokkhi haibadu nakhoina khang-i. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Adubu eigi hakchanggi phibham aduna nakhoida achouba changyeng oiraba phaobada nakhoina eibu hanthana khanbikhide aduga yadaba toukhide. Madugi mahutta Tengban mapugi swarga dut ama lousinbagum amadi Christta Jisu masamakpu lousinbagum nakhoina eibu lousinbikhi. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Nakhoi adukki matik haraorammi! Adubu kari toukhrabage? Ei isana haiba ngamgani adudi nakhoina yarabadi nakhoigi namit adu phaoba kotthoktuna madu eingonda piramgani. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Achumba asi nakhoida haibagidamak houjik ei nakhoigi yeknaba oirabra?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Atoppa makhoising aduna nakhoida thawai yamna yaoba matou utli adubu makhoigi pandam adudi aphaba natte. Makhoina pamba haibabu makhoina nakhoida thawai yaojaba adugumna nakhoinasu makhoida chap manaba thawai yaoba adu leinanaba nakhoibu eikhoidagi tokhai tahanba aduni. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Houjik, eina nakhoiga leiminnaringei matam asi khaktada nattaduna, aphaba maramgidamak oirabadi matam pumnamakta asigumba yamna thawai yaoba asi leiba phei. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Eigi nungsijaraba angangsa! Amukkasu hanna, mamana angang unaba matamda phaoba cheina aduga chap manaba cheina adu nakhoida Christtagi sakwong adu semgattriba phaoba eina nakhoigidamak phaojari. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Houjik eina nakhoiga loinana kayada leiminnajaningliba, aduga eigi wahei khonpham asi hongdokchaningba, maramdi eina nakhoigi maramda palleppham khangde.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagar amadi Sarah-gi pandam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Wayel Yathanggi makha ponna leiningba nakhoida eina hangge: Wayel Yathangna kari haibage haibadu nakhoi tadabra? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Meihou 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char></note>Maramdi masi iduna lei, madudi Abraham-gi macha ani lei, amana minai nupigi machani, aduga amana maningtambi nupigi machani. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Minai nupina pokpa mahakki macha adudi hachanggi matung-inna pokpani aduga maningtambina pokpa mahakki macha aduna Tengban Mapugi wasakpiba adugi mahei oina pokpani. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Hairibasing asi pandam oina haibani. Nupi ani asina utlibasi warepnaba anini. Macha adubu minai oina pokpa adu Hagarni, aduga mahakna Sinai chingda warepnakhiba warepnaba adu phongdokpibani. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Hagarna Arabia-da leiba Sinai Ching adu utpani aduga houjik oiriba Jerusalem saharga pangkhakni, maramdi mahakna mahakki machasingga loinana minai oiri. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Adubu swargagi oiba Jerusalem asidi maningtambini, aduga mahakti eikhoigi imani. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref></char></note>Maramdi, Mapugi Puyana hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Haraojaro, he chaboktabi nupi, angang amata poktribi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Haraobaga loinana lao amadi khonjel thokna lao, naoyek amukta phangdribi nahak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Maramdi hundokpiramlabi nupigi machasing aduna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">mapuroibana keidounungda thadoktabi nupi adugi machasingdagi masing yamgani.<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Ichil-inaosa, houjik nakhoi Isaac-na oikhibagumna, Tengban Mapuna wasakpikhiba adugi mahei oina phangjaba Tengban Mapugi machasingni. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Meihou 21:9</ref></char></note>Matam aduda hakchanggi matung-inna pokkhiba macha aduna Tengban Mapugi Thawaigi matung-inna pokpa mahak adubu ot-neibikhi. Aduga maduga chap mannana houjiksu oiri. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Meihou 21:10</ref></char></note>Adubu Mapugi Puyana kari haibage? “Minai nupi amasung machanupa adu tanthokkhro, maramdi minai nupina pokpa macha aduna maning tambi nupina pokpa macha aduga mapagi lanthum adu saruk phangminnaroidabani.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Maram aduna, ichil-inaosa, eikhoi minai nupigi machasing natte adubu maning tambigi machasingni.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Christtada ningtamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Christtana eikhoibu ningtamhankhiba adu eikhoina ningtamba oinabagidamaktani. Maram aduna chetna leppu aduga amuk hanna minaigi potpu adubu nasada thonggatchaganu.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Tao, Paul eina nakhoida hairi madudi nakhoi un kakpada yajarabadi, Christtadi nakhoida kanaba suklei leitre. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Un kakpada yajariba mi khudingda eina amukka hanna cheksin wa asi hairi madudi mahakna wayel yathang apumba inba tabani. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Wayel yathang ngaktuna chumhanbinaba hotnariba nakhoi Christtadagi tokhaina tarabani; nakhoi Tengban Mapugi thoujalgi wangmada leirabani. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Adubu, eikhoigidamaktadi, Tengban Mapuna eikhoibu mahakki mangda chumhanbigani haiba asina eikhoigi ashani; aduga Tengban Mapugi Thawaigi panggalgi mapanna eikhoigi thajabana eikhoina khourangna ngaijariba adu masini. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Maramdi eikhoina Christta Jisuga amata oina punsinjaba matamda un kakpagi amadi kaktabagi khetnaba karisu leite. Maruoiriba adudi nungsibagi mapanna thabak touriba thajaba aduni.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Nakhoina ningthina lamjel chelllammi! Achumba adu illamba adudagi kanana nakhoibu thingbage? Kamdouna mahakna nakhoibu themdokpage? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Asigumba makhalgi themdokpa asi nakhoibu koubiba Tengban Mapudagi lakpa natte. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 Cor 5:6</ref></char></note>Hamei khajiktana atotpa yam matum apumba kamkhathalli. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Adubu nakhoina atoppa wakhallon amata louroi haina eina Ibungoda thajei. Aduga nakhoibu chamamnahalliba mahak adu kana kana oirabasu Tengban Mapuna mahakpu cheirak pigani.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Adubu ichil inaosa, eigi oinadi, un kakpa asi tangaiphadabani haina eina houjik phaoba sandoklabadi, karigi eibu houjik phaoba ot neibiribano? Aduga maduna achumba oiramlabadi eina cross-ki maramda sandokliba asina khudi thiba thokhallamloidabani. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Nakhoibu pukning olhalliba makhoina un kakpadagi hendokna masa onhanjaramlabadi eina penjaramgadabani.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Ichil inaosa, nakhoibu ningtamhannaba koubibani. Adubu nakhoigi naning tamba adu hakchanggi apamba adu thunghannabagi oina sijinnaganu. Madugi mahutta nungsibagi mapanna nakhoi amaga amaga thougal tounou. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levi 19:18</ref></char></note>Maramdi wayel yathang apumba adu yathang amakhak asi ngakpana thunghallabani: “Nakhoina nakhoigi yumlon keironnababu nasamakum nungsiyu” <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Adubu nakhoina lamlakki sagumna amaga amaga chiknaduna chathoknarabadi, cheksillu nattrabadi amana amabu pummang manghalnaragani.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thawai amadi hakchanggi thabaksing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Aduna eina hairi, Thawaigi mapanna chatlu, adu oirabadi nakhoina hakchanggi apambasing adu thunghalloi. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Rom 7:15-23</ref></char></note>Maramdi hakchanggi apamba aduna thawaigi apamsing adugi maiyokta lei, aduga thawaigi apamba aduna hakchanggi oiba adugi maiyokta lei. Nakhoigi apamba adu nakhoina toudananaba makhoina amaga amaga yetnei. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Nakhoibu Thawai aduna chingbirabadi, nakhoina wayel yathanggi makha pondre.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Aduga hakchanggi thabaksing adudi mayek seng-i: nupa nupi lannaba, amotpa thabak, lamchat ludaba, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>lai murti latpa, hikap yaikappa, yengthinaba, mot tinnadaba, kalak khambannaba, mei houna saoba, marannai tanba, saona khatnaba, kanglup tannaba, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>khambanba, yu ngaoba, makhe langba, aduga masiga mannaba makhei asini. Eina mamangda haikhibagum cheksin wa asi nakhoida hairi: asigumba thabaksing asi touba makhoising aduna Tengban Mapugi leibak adu phangloi.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Adubu thawaigi maheidi nungsiba, haraoba, ingthaba, khaangheiba, chanbiheiba, aphaba, thajaba yaba, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>pukning tappa, amadi masa khudum chanjabani. Hairibasing asigi maiyokta wayel yathang amata leite. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Aduga Christta Jisugi oikhrabasing aduna hakchang adu madugi phattaba pukning ihulsing amasung apambasing pumnamakka loinana cross-ta hatkhre. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Eikhoina Thawaigi mapanna hingbagi maramna, eikhoina thawaigi mapanna chatsu chatsi. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Amaga amaga singnaduna amadi khambannaduna eikhoi napal tougumsi.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Atoppagi potlum puminnaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Ichil inaosa, karigumba papta taba mi amabu pharabadi, thawaigi mapanna hingliba nakhoina ing-tappaga loinana mahakpu hannagi maphamda hanjinhanbiyu. Aduga nakhoi nasamakpusu athemba aduda tadanaba nasana cheksinjou. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Nakhoi amana amagi potlum puminnou, matou asumna nakhoina Christtagi wayel yathang adu thunghallu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Kanagumbana karisu nattaba oiraga masabu karigumba amani haina khanjarabadi mahak masana masabu minamjarabani. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Mi khudingmakna masa masagi thabak chang yengjasanu. Maduna aphaba oirabadi, kanagumba ateina touba aduga changdamnaba toudana mahak masana toujaba adugidamak chaothokchasanu. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Maramdi nakhoi khudingna nasa nasagi potlum pujagadabani.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Tengban Mapugi wa tamjaba phangjariba mahak aduna mahakki leijaba aphaba pot khudingmak mahakpu tambiriba oja aduga saruk phangminnasanu.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Nasana nasabu minamhan-ganu; Tengban Mapubu noknaphade, maramdi mi amana hunkhi hunkhiba adumak mahakna lokkani. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Maramdi masagi hakchangbu pelhannaba hunba mahak aduna hachangdagi amangba lokchagani; adubu Thawai adubu pelhannaba hunba mahak aduna Thawai adudagi lomba naidana hingba lokchagani. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Maram aduna eikhoina aphaba toubada chokthagumsi; maramdi eikhoina chokthadrabadi achaba matamda eikhoina mahei lokkani. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Maram aduna eikhoina khudongchaba phangba phangbada, mi pumnamakta aphaba tousi, thoidok hendokna thajaba ichil inaosinggi imung manungda aphaba tousi.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aroiba cheksin wa amadi khurumjaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Yengbiyu, eigi ikhutmakna nakhoida kayada chaoba mayekna iriba! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Nakhoibu namduna un kak-hannaba hotnariba makhoising adu hakchanggi mapanna misingbu pelhannaba hotnariba mising aduni. Christtagi cross-ki maramgidamak makhoibu ot-neidanaba khaktagidamak makhoina madu toubani. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Un kaklaba makhoi aduna phaoba wayel yathang adu inde; adumakpu nakhoigi hakchangda un kakpa adugi maramda makhoina chaothokchanaba nakhoibu un kakpa adu makhoina pammi. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Adubu eigidamaktadi eikhoigi Ibungo Jisu Christtagi cross-ki maramkhaktagidamak nattana keidounungda eina chaothoktasanu; maramdi Ibungogi cross-ki mapanna taibangpan asina eingonda aduga eina taibangpanda cross-ta sire. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Un kakpa nattraga kaktaba haiba adu karisu natte; adubu maruoiba adudi anouba khutsem ama oibaduni. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Pathap asibu illiba makhoising adugi mathakta amadi Tengban Mapugi oiba Israel-gi mathakta ingthaba amadi chanbiba oisanu.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Houjiktagi houduna, kana amatana eingonda awaba pidasanu, maramdi eigi hakchangda leiriba dakpham asina eihak Ibungo Jisugi minai amani haiba utlabani.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Ichil inaosa, eikhoigi Ibungo Jisu Christtagi thoujal aduna nakhoigi thawaiga loinabisanu. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
